\">Product Table</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-5\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-3\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Video</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-6\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-4\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Review</a>\n                      </li>\n              </ul>\n      <div class=\"tab-content\">\n                              <div class=\"module-item module-item-2 tab-pane active\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-1\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-description\">\n                <h3>The Seagate Exos 7E10 10TB Enterprise HDD is a high-capacity, reliable storage solution designed for data centers, enterprise servers, and mission-critical applications. Built with advanced CMR (Conventional Magnetic Recording) technology, this drive delivers consistent performance, enhanced data integrity, and long-term reliability.</h3><p><br></p><p>Operating at 7200 RPM with a high-speed 12Gb/s SAS interface, the Exos 7E10 ensures fast data transfer rates and optimized workload handling. It is engineered for 24/7 operation, making it ideal for high-demand environments such as cloud storage, RAID arrays, and enterprise backup systems.</p><p><br></p><p>With enterprise-class features like advanced caching, rotational vibration tolerance, and enhanced error correction, this HDD provides stable performance even in multi-drive environments. The 10TB capacity allows businesses to efficiently manage large-scale data storage while reducing infrastructure costs.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features</h3><p><br></p><ul><li>10TB high-capacity enterprise storage</li><li>7200 RPM spindle speed for reliable performance</li><li>12Gb/s SAS interface for high-speed data transfer</li><li>3.5-inch form factor</li><li>Built with CMR technology for consistent performance</li><li>Designed for 24/7 enterprise workloads</li><li>Enhanced rotational vibration (RV) sensors</li><li>High reliability with enterprise-grade durability</li><li>Optimized for RAID and multi-bay environments</li></ul>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                <div class=\"module-compatibility-table\" id=\"tab-compatibility\">\n            <h3>Product List</h3>\n        <div class=\"module-compatibility-table-content\">\n      \n        <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n          <table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><strong></strong></td>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\"><strong>Price</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n                                <tr>    \n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><a href=\"/hpe-900gb-25in-10k-6gbps-enterprise-sas-hard-drive\">HPE 900GB 2.5in 10K 6Gbps Enterprise SAS Hard Drive</a></td>\n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\">\n                        <p class=\"price\"> \n                             \n                                <span class=\"price-new\">15,000৳</span> \n                                <span class=\"price-old\">18,000৳</span> \n                                                         \n                        </p>                      \n                    </td>\n                </tr>\n                                <tr>    \n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><a href=\"/intel-ssd-d3-s4510-series-240gb-25-sata3-solid-state-drive-ssd\">Intel SSD